# Netlify headers — shipped inside the publish dir so the manual actions-netlify
# deploy honors them (the root netlify.toml is dead config under that deploy path).
# All matching rules apply, so /* security headers also cover the blocks below.

# CSP ships REPORT-ONLY deliberately: _headers cannot be exercised locally (the
# Vite dev server ignores this file), so enforcement flips post-deploy per the
# runbook after the violation reports come back clean. Every source below is
# verified against the code: gtag.js + fbevents.js loaders (src/lib/analytics.ts),
# GA4/Pixel beacon endpoints, the fly.dev API + uploads origin
# (src/lib/api-internal.ts), simpleicons brand logos (src/lib/brand-logo-urls.ts),
# unsplash fallback imagery (StoreGallery/CategoryGrid/PromoMegaBlocks/about),
# data:/blob: for CSS svg data-URIs and object-URL previews. frame-src is 'none'
# (no iframe is rendered anywhere; showroom video entries are filtered out).
# frame-ancestors is omitted: it is ignored in Report-Only — clickjacking stays
# covered by the X-Frame-Options: DENY header below until enforcement flips.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://connect.facebook.net; connect-src 'self' https://freezone-website.fly.dev https://*.google-analytics.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com https://www.facebook.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://freezone-website.fly.dev https://images.unsplash.com https://cdn.simpleicons.org https://www.facebook.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; media-src 'self' https://freezone-website.fly.dev; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

# Vite emits content-hashed filenames under /assets — safe to cache forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Admin panel must never be indexed (also disallowed in robots.txt).
/dashboard/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/favicon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/brand/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
